WEBVTT

00:08.490 --> 00:12.870
Can't focus. My body is still puzzled about what to do.

00:08.490 --> 00:12.870
Shuuchuu dekitenaina mada karada ga mayotteirunda

00:12.870 --> 00:16.630
I'm trembling. I can't stop even if I try to control myself.

00:12.870 --> 00:16.630
Furueteitanja kontoroorushitatte burerunda

00:16.630 --> 00:20.380
Although neither sun nor moon are on my side,

00:16.630 --> 00:20.380
Taiyou mo tsuki mo nanmo kanzen ni kocchi muiteinaiga

00:20.380 --> 00:21.800
"I've no choice but to try,"

00:20.380 --> 00:21.800
Yarushikanainda

00:21.800 --> 00:24.470
Those were the words I muttered to myself.

00:21.800 --> 00:24.470
Iikikaseruyouni sotto tsubuyaita

00:26.140 --> 00:30.060
The odds aren't on my side, but running way'd be gutless.

00:26.140 --> 00:30.060
Joukyou wa waruiga tada nigedasunja konjou nainaa

00:30.140 --> 00:34.060
Even if I can't see the future, I'll just have to win it over with courage.

00:30.140 --> 00:34.060
Tenbou wa naiga dokyou de kuria suru shika naiya

00:34.060 --> 00:37.560
Need to keep distance from the target as I hold myself back.

00:34.060 --> 00:37.560
Shoudou wa osaetamama taagetto to no kankaku sagure

00:37.770 --> 00:40.860
All that's needed for victory is pride to win.

00:37.770 --> 00:40.860
Hitsuyou na mon wa katsu puraido

00:40.860 --> 00:43.950
Will we celebrate with the wine of victory

00:40.860 --> 00:43.950
Ajiwau nowa shouri no bishu ka

00:43.950 --> 00:47.950
Or'll we end up kissing their feet in defeat?

00:43.950 --> 00:47.950
Soretomo haiboku no kujuu ka

00:47.950 --> 00:51.700
There are two outcomes to everything.

00:47.950 --> 00:51.700
Sou subete wa futatsu ni hitotsu

00:51.700 --> 00:55.420
I want to control destiny.

00:51.700 --> 00:55.420
Ayatsuritai unmei no ito

00:56.830 --> 01:00.750
I need to seize the golden opportunity with my hands.

00:56.830 --> 01:00.750
Zekkou no goorudentaimu kono te de tsukame

01:00.750 --> 01:04.840
I'll finish it up with my best poker face,

01:00.750 --> 01:04.840
Konshin no pookaafeisu kimete shikakeruyo

01:04.840 --> 01:09.800
And drag them into a world of illusions.

01:04.840 --> 01:09.800
Iryuujon no sekai e hikizurikonde

01:12.180 --> 01:16.140
I'll find my way out of this endless pressure game,

01:12.180 --> 01:16.140
Saigennai puresshaageemu sururito nukete

01:16.140 --> 01:20.150
And leap over the borderline of honor.

01:16.140 --> 01:20.150
Eikou no boodaarain tobikoeru tameni

01:20.150 --> 01:24.860
How many? What'll I need to sacrifice to make it happen?

01:20.150 --> 01:24.860
Haumenii? Dorekurai no daishou ga iru?

01:24.860 --> 01:29.120
What is the one thing I don't want to let go?

01:24.860 --> 01:29.120
Tebanashitakunai mon wa dore?

01:41.400 --> 01:43.530
Hey, where the hell are you taking us?

01:43.530 --> 01:44.610
Get in.

02:03.420 --> 02:04.300
This is...

02:06.550 --> 02:08.180
Military Headquarters?!

02:08.180 --> 02:09.680
What does this mean?!

02:10.810 --> 02:11.720
Hey.

02:12.640 --> 02:14.520
You guys are filthy.

02:17.020 --> 02:21.650
I wouldn't have dreamed the Homunculi's hideout was under Headquarters...

02:21.650 --> 02:26.780
So it means that the army is also associated with them, not just the Führer President.

02:28.370 --> 02:31.620
But I've got something good to tell you, too.

02:35.250 --> 02:38.080
Really?! You really found my body?!

02:38.080 --> 02:39.210
Yeah.

02:39.210 --> 02:43.460
Although you told me,
"You're not my soul, so I can't come with you."

02:44.010 --> 02:47.010
Great, so my body still exists!

02:47.010 --> 02:48.720
Awesome! Awesome!

02:48.720 --> 02:49.720
Okay!

02:52.010 --> 02:55.810
This just means we're one step closer to our goal.

02:57.310 --> 03:00.610
Hey, why do you still have that cat?

03:00.610 --> 03:01.940
Oh, her?

03:01.940 --> 03:03.280
Actually, inside of me, there's...

03:03.780 --> 03:04.940
What?!

03:04.940 --> 03:06.650
That midget?!

03:06.650 --> 03:08.700
Brother! Stop being so loud!

03:08.700 --> 03:10.990
Hurry and put your underwear on!

03:11.530 --> 03:13.240
What are you guys doing?! Hurry up!

03:15.040 --> 03:17.210
No!!!

03:18.070 --> 03:21.070
Struggle of the Fool

03:18.070 --> 03:21.070
Struggle of the Fool

03:25.050 --> 03:28.430
Geez, why the hell did you have to bring her?

03:28.430 --> 03:31.260
There was no other choice. She's injured.

03:31.260 --> 03:31.970
Hey!

03:32.680 --> 03:36.180
I'm leaving the rest to Wrath. Go in.

03:36.480 --> 03:37.680
Wrath?

03:45.280 --> 03:46.240
Wrath...

03:46.650 --> 03:49.450
Führer President King Bradley?!

03:52.450 --> 03:53.530
Colonel!

03:54.660 --> 03:55.830
What the hell happened?

03:55.830 --> 03:57.250
Quite a bit.

03:58.040 --> 04:01.540
Sergeant Fuery was transferred to the South, Warrant Officer Falman to the North,

04:01.540 --> 04:03.540
and Second Lieutenant Breda to the West.

04:04.130 --> 04:06.920
And Lieutenant Hawkeye is going to be an assistant to the Führer President.

04:10.630 --> 04:12.220
What the hell...

04:12.220 --> 04:14.560
That's no more than taking hostages.

04:16.890 --> 04:18.560
Have a seat.

04:21.600 --> 04:25.570
Right now, it's just us and the Führer President in this room.

04:25.820 --> 04:28.190
And he only has one weapon; a sword.

04:28.780 --> 04:32.030
Yet, he's still confident he can beat all three of us?

04:38.620 --> 04:39.540
Führer President!

04:41.080 --> 04:44.960
You came to visit me in the hospital once, right?

04:44.960 --> 04:46.800
I was completely fooled.

04:47.050 --> 04:51.510
"Don't meddle in things.
Think of the entire army as your enemy."

04:51.970 --> 04:53.800
That's what I told you.

04:54.760 --> 04:57.970
You are all important to us.

04:58.560 --> 05:00.680
You don't need to know about the minor details,

05:01.100 --> 05:04.100
but behave until the time comes.

05:04.690 --> 05:07.070
As long as you keep that promise, we won't harm you.

05:07.070 --> 05:12.950
And when that time comes, what'll happen to the civilians who aren't "human sacrifices" like us?

05:13.530 --> 05:16.910
I just told you. You don't need to know the minor details,

05:16.910 --> 05:18.700
Fullmetal Alchemist.

05:20.290 --> 05:22.710
"Fullmetal Alchemist", eh?

05:23.710 --> 05:27.960
I chose to become a dog of the military in order to get my body back.

05:27.960 --> 05:35.050
But the State Alchemist Institution itself was probably created to pick out these sacrifices.

05:35.050 --> 05:38.430
If I'm going to be used by you guys again on top of that...

05:41.020 --> 05:43.640
I quit my job as a State Alchemist!

05:44.390 --> 05:48.400
Your proof of being a dog is covered in blood.

05:48.400 --> 05:53.650
Whatever you guys are planning, I'll put an end to it.

05:53.650 --> 05:56.200
I'll tell the other alchemists, and...

05:56.200 --> 05:58.910
What was her name again?

05:59.080 --> 06:02.080
Oh, that's right. Winry Rockbell.

06:03.500 --> 06:05.500
Born in Resembool.

06:05.500 --> 06:09.500
A childhood friend of yours
and someone who is practically family.

06:09.500 --> 06:11.840
A skilled automail mechanic.

06:12.090 --> 06:16.680
She currently works at Rush Valley,
and she's loved by her customers and friends.

06:16.680 --> 06:18.720
She's a good, obedient girl.

06:20.720 --> 06:24.180
Lay a finger on her and see what happens! People around her, too!

06:24.890 --> 06:26.560
So, what are you going to do?

06:28.520 --> 06:32.280
If you still want to quit, then I'll cut her down.

06:40.700 --> 06:42.290
Excellent.

06:42.290 --> 06:43.290
Excuse me...

06:43.910 --> 06:46.040
We get the idea.

06:46.040 --> 06:47.420
So, umm...

06:47.420 --> 06:54.550
Like before, please let us continue to search for clues
for getting our bodies back while being under surveillance.

06:54.970 --> 06:56.170
Please.

06:57.180 --> 06:58.590
Very well.

06:58.590 --> 07:01.180
As long as you don't interfere with our plan.

07:01.180 --> 07:03.220
What will you do, Colonel Mustang?

07:03.220 --> 07:06.310
You're not going to tell me that you plan to resign from the military too, are you?

07:06.600 --> 07:11.980
Let's see... even if I became a dog of the military, I'd rather not become a loser.

07:13.440 --> 07:20.490
Either way, because of my ambition, I won't be able to take off this uniform or get rid of this. For now, at least.

07:21.410 --> 07:22.870
Very well.

07:22.870 --> 07:24.490
You all may leave.

07:27.330 --> 07:30.420
May I ask you one thing, sir?

07:30.630 --> 07:32.750
What is it, Colonel?

07:32.750 --> 07:34.840
Are you the one who killed Hughes?

07:36.880 --> 07:39.380
No, it was not me.

07:39.680 --> 07:40.640
Then who?

07:40.930 --> 07:43.140
You said "one thing", did you not?

07:45.770 --> 07:47.100
Please excuse me.

07:48.190 --> 07:50.600
Oh. Wait a moment, Alphonse.

08:01.070 --> 08:02.990
U-Umm... Is there something...

08:03.370 --> 08:05.870
No, you may leave now.

08:12.290 --> 08:13.710
That was so close!

08:13.920 --> 08:16.000
A sword just went right over my head...

08:16.880 --> 08:18.170
Oh yeah, Colonel.

08:18.670 --> 08:20.970
Money. Lend me some change.

08:20.970 --> 08:22.550
What's this all of a sudden?

08:23.050 --> 08:24.180
Don't worry about it!

08:24.600 --> 08:26.850
Man, this is all you got?

08:26.850 --> 08:28.520
What are you, a thief?!

08:28.520 --> 08:29.600
Oh well.

08:29.600 --> 08:30.600
Later!

08:30.600 --> 08:31.100
H-Hey!

08:31.390 --> 08:32.690
Sorry, Colonel!

08:32.690 --> 08:34.020
We'll report everything later!

08:35.190 --> 08:36.730
What in the world are they up to?

08:37.480 --> 08:39.280
Oh no, the Lieutenant!

08:46.410 --> 08:47.290
Lieute-

08:49.790 --> 08:52.170
Is something the matter, Colonel?

08:52.170 --> 08:54.040
You don't look very well.

08:54.210 --> 09:00.170
Can you blame me for feeling sick after seeing a musclehead when I was expecting to see a woman?

09:00.510 --> 09:01.420
Colonel!

09:02.260 --> 09:03.300
Lieutenant.

09:03.300 --> 09:04.590
Is everything okay?

09:04.590 --> 09:06.300
Oh, my apologies.

09:06.640 --> 09:09.560
Lieutenant Hawkeye, just returning from the restroom, sir.

09:10.230 --> 09:14.310
I accepted Major Armstrong's kindness and had him take my place for a short time.

09:15.020 --> 09:17.110
Thank you, Major.

09:17.110 --> 09:18.570
No problem at all.

09:19.150 --> 09:20.530
You didn't run away?

09:21.030 --> 09:24.780
Who's the one who told me
to never give up no matter what?

09:26.370 --> 09:30.790
Don't regret later that you didn't run away, Lieutenant.

09:31.160 --> 09:32.580
Like I will after all this time...

09:36.630 --> 09:38.000
Hello?

09:38.590 --> 09:41.170
Ed? What's with the sudden call?

09:41.630 --> 09:43.220
Did you break your automail again?

09:43.220 --> 09:44.260
No!

09:44.260 --> 09:45.840
Hey, are you okay?

09:45.840 --> 09:47.010
Are you doing well?

09:47.180 --> 09:48.930
Anything new in your life?

09:48.930 --> 09:51.310
You're not being stalked by anyone, are you?

09:52.640 --> 09:53.520
Ed...

09:53.690 --> 09:54.520
What is it?!

09:54.980 --> 09:56.020
You're being creepy.

09:57.690 --> 09:58.770
What did you say?!

09:58.770 --> 10:05.200
I mean, it's rare enough for you to call, and it turns out you're worried about me?

10:05.200 --> 10:08.280
Geez, there's something wrong here.
I bet it's going to snow tonight or something.

10:08.280 --> 10:10.330
Hey! Do you have any idea how much I-

10:10.330 --> 10:11.160
Hey, thanks.

10:12.620 --> 10:14.830
I'm happy you called.

10:15.830 --> 10:16.920
Thanks.

10:16.920 --> 10:18.380
S-Sure.

10:18.380 --> 10:20.460
So you're really okay, right?

10:21.800 --> 10:23.550
Got it. Bye.

10:26.220 --> 10:28.220
Good, she was fine...

10:28.220 --> 10:31.680
It's your excitable nature that lets people take advantage of you.

10:32.560 --> 10:33.730
Ling!

10:33.730 --> 10:35.850
I told you, I'm Greed.

10:36.480 --> 10:37.900
What the hell do you want?!

10:39.190 --> 10:41.190
Your buddy asked me to give you this.

10:41.190 --> 10:42.150
Ling did?

10:43.440 --> 10:45.110
This is in Xing's language, huh...

10:45.110 --> 10:46.700
What's it say?

10:46.700 --> 10:48.620
I don't know. Can't read it.

10:48.620 --> 10:51.370
He wants you to give it to the woman waiting for him.

10:51.370 --> 10:52.240
Lan Fa-

10:52.950 --> 10:56.210
You're not planning on following us and killing her, are you?

10:56.500 --> 10:58.420
I'm not that low.

10:58.420 --> 11:00.710
Besides, I don't like fighting girls.

11:02.210 --> 11:05.630
I don't lie.

11:05.630 --> 11:06.970
Later. Be sure to give it to her.

11:09.510 --> 11:10.470
Hey, Ling!

11:11.350 --> 11:12.810
I'm Greed.

11:28.610 --> 11:30.450
Who the hell was that?

11:31.160 --> 11:35.620
What reason did he have to start the civil war
when it would ruin this country?

11:38.790 --> 11:39.790
Who is it?

11:42.750 --> 11:44.590
Is someone up there?

11:48.550 --> 11:50.180
You're injured.

11:50.640 --> 11:52.220
Could you come down?

11:52.800 --> 11:54.680
I'd like to know what's going on outside.

11:55.680 --> 11:58.940
It's fine; the guard won't be coming again for a while.

11:58.940 --> 12:02.060
I'm also a doctor. I'll tend your wounds.

12:07.940 --> 12:09.610
An Ishbalan, huh?

12:09.610 --> 12:11.110
That scar on your forehead...

12:11.780 --> 12:13.530
Don't tell me... You're Scar?!

12:13.530 --> 12:15.620
Who the hell are you?

12:15.620 --> 12:17.290
What are you doing here?

12:24.460 --> 12:25.550
Oh, God!

12:27.420 --> 12:28.800
I'm...

12:29.010 --> 12:33.300
I'm also an alchemist who assisted in the Ishbal Extermination!

12:37.600 --> 12:40.690
She'll be fine. Nothing life-threatening.

12:40.850 --> 12:43.440
She'll get better as long as she gets some rest.

12:43.440 --> 12:44.810
Thank goodness.

12:44.810 --> 12:46.270
"Thank goodness" my ass!

12:46.730 --> 12:48.820
Giving me more patients by the day!

12:48.820 --> 12:50.570
Both my bed and sofa are occupied!

12:50.570 --> 12:53.320
Where the hell am I supposed to sleep, huh?!

12:53.320 --> 12:55.530
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

12:55.530 --> 12:58.200
Besides, two patients in my house at once?!

12:55.830 --> 12:57.040
Alphonse.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.200
Lan Fan!

12:58.200 --> 13:00.620
You shouldn't be up!

13:00.620 --> 13:03.790
Is... Is the young master not with you?

13:04.500 --> 13:07.000
I-It's fine. He's alive.

13:07.420 --> 13:09.510
I have a message from him.

13:17.310 --> 13:18.310
Lan Fan?

13:20.560 --> 13:24.400
He says... He says he's obtained a philosopher's stone...

13:25.400 --> 13:26.940
With this, our clan is...

13:28.070 --> 13:33.280
That's right! I must return to my country immediately and tell my people!

13:33.570 --> 13:35.990
Where is he? Where is the young master?

13:37.830 --> 13:40.200
What? Why won't you speak?

13:40.500 --> 13:42.580
Don't tell me something happened to him!

13:42.750 --> 13:44.460
Answer me, Alphonse!

13:44.460 --> 13:45.830
Where is the young master?!

13:50.170 --> 13:53.300
How is your body feeling, Greed?

13:53.300 --> 13:55.220
So you're Wrath.

13:55.220 --> 13:56.550
I'm feeling fine.

13:56.550 --> 14:00.640
Did you hear? This body belongs to a prince of Xing.

14:00.930 --> 14:06.100
He wanted power that would help him become Emperor, and thus accepted me.

14:06.100 --> 14:07.770
He's a really interesting guy.

14:08.980 --> 14:14.400
Him and I once had a discussion on what it means to be a true king.

14:14.400 --> 14:20.410
He said something like, "A King exists for his people. Without his people, there is no King."

14:21.120 --> 14:25.500
What an idiot. He gave in to greed and lost everything.

14:25.500 --> 14:27.040
Shut up!

14:27.790 --> 14:29.250
Don't underestimate us humans!

14:31.210 --> 14:32.670
That's how it is.

14:32.670 --> 14:37.510
He's vigilantly watching for a chance to take over.

14:38.680 --> 14:41.890
He's even planning on taking control of a monster?

14:42.720 --> 14:45.480
How greedy can these humans get?

14:51.020 --> 14:53.360
The Führer President is a Homunculus?!

14:55.700 --> 15:01.370
It's always been my honor to fight for the weak citizens of this country.

15:02.200 --> 15:06.960
Many people feel the same,
believe in the military, and sign up.

15:07.830 --> 15:10.380
And yet, the military itself...

15:11.130 --> 15:12.800
Why not resign?

15:13.630 --> 15:16.880
With your personality, being a soldier will only hurt you.

15:20.890 --> 15:23.770
Sir! This is wrong!

15:24.180 --> 15:26.640
Are you going against military command?!

15:26.640 --> 15:30.060
Whatever! Call for a replacement State Alchemist!

15:32.650 --> 15:36.740
I ran from battle during Ishbal...

15:36.740 --> 15:38.910
...because I thought what the army was doing was wrong.

15:38.910 --> 15:45.500
But instead, I should have fought against it instead of running away.

15:47.210 --> 15:53.750
Since then, not a day has passed that I didn't feel ashamed for bending my principles and fleeing.

15:54.670 --> 16:02.180
And this time, if the army itself is the battlefield, how can I run away again?

16:04.930 --> 16:07.730
What are you going to do now, Colonel?

16:07.730 --> 16:11.940
I told the Führer President I wouldn't quit because I still have an ambition.

16:13.310 --> 16:19.950
The fact the Führer President revealed he's a Homunculus means that even if he was to be defeated,

16:19.950 --> 16:22.620
there's still someone else in the shadows.

16:23.620 --> 16:24.830
I'm being tested.

16:25.660 --> 16:26.790
Don't you think that's an honor?

16:27.500 --> 16:29.290
You're being pretty calm about this.

16:29.290 --> 16:30.540
I don't know if I'd say that.

16:31.370 --> 16:35.800
It was the same when I fought that other Homunculus, Lust, but...

16:36.550 --> 16:41.720
Although people accuse me of being a "weapon" and a "monster", when fighting against real monsters...

16:42.340 --> 16:45.680
...I truly feel as though I'm nothing but an ordinary human.

16:47.930 --> 16:49.230
I see.

16:49.640 --> 16:53.230
So the young master took in the stone.

16:54.020 --> 16:54.980
Sorry.

16:55.360 --> 16:57.280
If only we had been able to stop him...

16:57.650 --> 16:59.360
You don't need to apologize.

16:59.740 --> 17:03.240
I am only mad at myself for not being able to fulfill my duty as a bodyguard.

17:04.410 --> 17:05.700
So...

17:06.410 --> 17:10.330
So the young master is still inside this Greed person, right?

17:13.580 --> 17:17.250
Alphonse, I want a replacement arm. And quick.

17:17.250 --> 17:19.420
But... it'll take some time...

17:19.960 --> 17:22.840
Please introduce me to an automail mechanic! Please!

17:29.270 --> 17:30.520
Okay.

17:30.520 --> 17:32.440
I will soon.

17:32.850 --> 17:35.650
But you have to get better before I do that.

17:35.650 --> 17:38.360
Let's get you something to eat from Dr. Nox...

17:39.150 --> 17:41.070
You can get up now?

17:41.070 --> 17:43.360
Let's see... was your name May Chan?

17:43.530 --> 17:44.360
May?!

17:49.160 --> 17:49.990
What?!

17:51.540 --> 17:53.410
As expected of the Yao Clan's watchdog.

17:53.670 --> 17:56.580
And you're... the Chan Clan's successor.

17:56.580 --> 17:57.710
Indeed.

17:57.710 --> 18:00.380
I'm the 17th Princess of Xing, May Chan.

17:57.710 --> 17:59.920
Wait... um...

18:00.920 --> 18:05.010
If you're here in this country, it means... you're after immortality, as well.

18:05.220 --> 18:07.760
I'll never let you and your clan have it!

18:08.970 --> 18:11.060
You won't even be able to find it!

18:12.230 --> 18:14.060
Hang on!

18:14.060 --> 18:16.770
I don't really get it, but let's play nice!

18:16.770 --> 18:19.730
Don't interfere with our country's affairs!

18:16.770 --> 18:19.730
Don't interfere with our country's affairs!

18:20.400 --> 18:22.490
Don't underestimate me just because I'm injured.

18:22.490 --> 18:25.490
Same to you!

18:27.070 --> 18:29.580
What the hell are you two doing?!

18:32.160 --> 18:34.210
Patients should be asleep in bed!

18:34.710 --> 18:36.460
Don't interfere with our country's...

18:36.460 --> 18:39.840
Hell if I care about your country's affairs, moron!

18:40.710 --> 18:41.630
Geez!

18:41.630 --> 18:44.420
Patients are patients, no matter what country they're in!

18:46.630 --> 18:49.970
You're planning on messing up my house even more?

18:49.970 --> 18:51.010
Hey...

18:51.010 --> 18:55.310
